This "reference" could be done in the actual data.table, but I wanted to
avoid it due to size concerns.  In the event that we want to do rolling
calls by groups, we could have a lot of redundant data inside the
data.table. This redundant data could possibly bloat the data to be VERY
VERY large if we are not careful.  A separate table helps to alleviate this
problem.  This is especially true in this case (where we implicitly only
have 1 group).

